  "description": "Third Drupal instance: Mass.gov on Drupal 10.3.6, where drupal/core-recommended pins the Symfony components and Twig with tilde constraints (~v6.4.7, ~v6.4.8, ~v3.14.0) that permit the patch releases carrying the November 2024 fixes. Five advisories on four packages (symfony/http-foundation, symfony/process, symfony/http-client, twig/twig x2) are each a plain one-package update and one combined command fixes all five; the http-client path runs through two abandoned packages (fabpot/goutte, behat/mink-goutte-driver), which the report flags.",
